    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631350/extras/0bea54b09ad5fa066669799cd6802e08.avif?t=1737023637\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helen is a cozy narrative adventure that follows the life of Helen, a young woman balancing the pressures of office work and her passion for content creation. Struggling with a quarter-life crisis, Helen embarks on a soul-searching journey to rediscover herself, find joy in the small things, and navigate the complexities of adulthood. With interactive journaling, heartfelt conversations, and a vibrant 2010s Indonesia setting, <i>Helen</i> invites you to explore a world of self-discovery, meaningful relationships, and personal growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FINDING HAPPINESS IN LIFE'S SMALL THINGS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631350/extras/2cbde1941c9e2f54d614820afb842fbc.poster.avif?t=1737023637\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631350/extras/2cbde1941c9e2f54d614820afb842fbc.webm?t=1737023637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631350/extras/2cbde1941c9e2f54d614820afb842fbc.mp4?t=1737023637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631350/extras/8a8e73c60f56c055c2c48a476546d815.poster.avif?t=1737023637\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2631350